    {
      "zh": "圣诞鹿",
      "en": "Rudolph",
      "id": "5000014",
      "category": "pet",
      "fieldType": "name",
      "source": "String.wz\\Pet.img.xml"
    },
    {
      "zh": "性格有点文静.但圣诞老人选择\\n它以后性格变得很活泼了.是一\\n个很善良而且可爱的小驯鹿...",
      "en": "They are smart and obedient by nature, picking up commands faster than other pets, but they also can get hungry in a hurry.",
      "id": "5000015",
      "category": "pet",
      "fieldType": "desc",
      "source": "String.wz\\Pet.img.xml"
    },
    {
      "zh": "天才博士制作的机器人. 虽然是\\n机器但是拥有人类的情感...",
      "en": "A hyper-active robot that always changes its mind on everything. Very unpredictable, yet easy to please.",
      "id": "5000017",
      "category": "pet",
      "fieldType": "desc",
      "source": "String.wz\\Pet.img.xml"
    },
    {
      "zh": "性格开朗.但有时候比较文静.饭\\n量不多.聪明,很听话...",
      "en": "Active, yet calm at times. Can be moderately fed. Very smart in general. ",
      "id": "5000018",
      "category": "pet",
      "fieldType": "desc",
      "source": "String.wz\\Pet.img.xml"
    },
    {
      "zh": "小白雪人会默默地陪在主人身边\\n,是个值得信赖的好伙伴!它会默\\n默地为主人完成很多事情喔!",
      "en": "A trustworthy pet that quietly watches everyone&apos;s back. Quiet, but smart and gets a lot of things done.",
      "id": "5000020",
      "category": "pet",
      "fieldType": "desc",
      "source": "String.wz\\Pet.img.xml"
    },
    {
      "zh": "生性开朗,好奇心很重,带有自己\\n的聊天窗口与名牌...",
      "en": "Very charming who is also very intuitive, but not as obedient as some of the others",
      "id": "5000021",
      "category": "pet",
      "fieldType": "desc",
      "source": "String.wz\\Pet.img.xml"
    },
    {
      "zh": " 又淘气又活泼的总能让人快乐\\n的小火鸡.搞笑的表情是它的特\\n技...",
      "en": "Somewhat active, quiet and not well-behaved in nature. It is not very obedient, but isn&apos;t hungry very often.",
      "id": "5000022",
      "category": "pet",
      "fieldType": "desc",
      "source": "String.wz\\Pet.img.xml"
    },
