      "source": "String.wz\\Pet.img.xml"
    },
    {
      "zh": "幸运宠,全身上下散发着金色光\\n芒的小老虎啊呜啊呜. ",
      "en": "Baby Tiger, the big star of 2010. ",
      "id": "5000066",
      "category": "pet",
      "fieldType": "desc",
      "source": "String.wz\\Pet.img.xml"
    },
    {
      "zh": "特别喜欢闪烁的石头,性格开朗\\n的花蘑菇仔.#c拥有永恒的生命.#",
      "en": "A happy-go-lucky, orange mushroom that loves shiny stones.\\n#cA pet whose life will never expire.#",
      "id": "5000100",
      "category": "pet",
      "fieldType": "desc",
      "source": "String.wz\\Pet.img.xml"
    },
    {
      "zh": "性格温顺的小白虎,即使是陌生\\n人也会马上变得很亲密.#c拥有永\\n恒的生命.#",
      "en": "They are very gentle and obedient in nature, easily becoming friendly with the owner, which in turn speeds up the level-up process.\\n#cA pet whose life will never expire.#",
